35:43.710 --> 35:46.150
Lin Zhixia, kita berdua satu tim.

35:47.230 --> 35:47.920
Baik.

35:50.030 --> 35:50.800
Aku...

35:51.230 --> 35:52.030
Jiang Yubai.

35:53.960 --> 35:55.020
Kita satu tim saja.

35:55.230 --> 35:55.690
